      6 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">التَّخَاسِى</span></b>  <i>The throwing of pebbles, one at
another.</i> (K.) You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَخَاسَتْ قَوَائِمُ الدَّابَّةِ بِالحَصَا</span>
<i>The legs of the beast threw the pebbles, one at
another.</i> (TA.) [See also 3 in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خسأ</span>.)

